            "end": 592,
            "text": "I’m exploring ways to automate workflows for a food delivery application similar to DoorDash. I want to understand how n8n can help connect restaurant order systems, customer notifications, and delivery updates. Can n8n receive new order data through webhooks, notify restaurants automatically, and send customers real-time status updates through messaging integrations? What would be the best workflow structure for handling order confirmations, delivery assignments, and failed notifications? I’d appreciate suggestions on suitable nodes and best practices for building a reliable workflow.",
